Z||000004||mblackwell||07-20-2001||05:04 AM||||For people fortunate enough not to use AOL*:<P>For windows 98:<BR>Right-click on your desk top.  Choose new&gt;shortcut.<P>In the box that comes up type <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl</A> <P>Click next.  Type in Pennock's Fiero Forum.<P>Click next/finish.<P>A shortcut will appear.<P>Drag it into the area directly to the the right of your start button.<P>BAM! Instant access to the forum.<P><BR>*<sub>just a joke</sub><p>[This message has been edited by mblackwell (edited 07-20-2001).]||||reg||3
